From 2b7548c00667bd9b4e3b917484b185b2b5fe5eff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:04:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(track): treegens.app/track, the planting capture with no
 crypto

/track films a tree exactly as a planting is filmed, with no sign-in,
wallet, verifiers or MGRO, and /track/dashboard shows every tree with its
before and after videos to watch and download.

- The planting screen moves unchanged into
  components/capture/PlantingCapture.tsx; /submissions/create renders it
  as before, and /track renders it with `track`: a name field instead of
  the wallet notice, MGRO note and verifier copy.
- A /track clip carries `track: { device, planterName }` through the
  upload manager, its draft, its queue row and the service worker, and
  goes to /api/track/uploads under the phone's id, never under the
  sign-in token. Same resumable sessions, offline queue and recovery.
- Its own draft slots and its own open tree (treeLinks scope), so a
  planting's clip is never sent as a tracked tree, or the reverse.
- /track/dashboard: totals, planters, filters by planter and day,
  before/after players with downloads, CSV and URL list, auto refresh.
- /track is public, phone-only (record-only rule) and noindex; the
  dashboard renders full width on any screen.
- Tests: track cases in the upload manager, transport and service worker
  suites; harnesses updated for the moved screen and the new module.

